{"full":"hf:jimmycarter/krea2-turbo-bbox-canvas","spaceId":"jimmycarter/krea2-turbo-bbox-canvas","name":"Krea 2 Turbo BBox","source":"huggingface","description":"Layout-controlled comics with a draggable bbox canvas","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","mcp-server","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":56,"created":"2026-08-09T09:53:49.000Z","updated":"2026-10-03T19:18:55.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://jimmycarter-krea2-turbo-bbox-canvas.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/jimmycarter/krea2-turbo-bbox-canvas","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T05:07:05.892Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T05:07:05.892Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T05:07:05.892Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🧩","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Demo of jimmycarter/krea2-turbo-bbox — a Krea 2 finetune merged with the Turbo distillation delta (8 steps, no CFG).","The model was trained on a compact grounding DSL that places panels, characters, objects and verbatim text into explicit [x0,y0,x1,y1] boxes on a 0–1000 grid. This Space exposes that DSL directly and wraps it in a draggable box canvas: the canvas and the prompt textbox are two views of the same string, so moving a box rewrites its coordinates and editing the text redraws the canvas.","Example prompts span realistic photography (product shots, portraits, multi-subject scenes, landscapes), posters/typography, and multi-panel comics, plus plain-prose prompts — showing that the bbox layout control applies to any subject matter, not just comics."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/jimmycarter/krea2-turbo-bbox-canvas/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ccc5c9816e79ee3da7e315e57fa527d2640e51330a3c913144fdc71747405937","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T05:07:05.943Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T05:07:05.943Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Demo of jimmycarter/krea2-turbo-bbox — a Krea 2 finetune merged with the Turbo distillation delta (8 steps, no CFG).","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/jimmycarter/krea2-turbo-bbox-canvas/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"ccc5c9816e79ee3da7e315e57fa527d2640e51330a3c913144fdc71747405937","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/jimmycarter/krea2-turbo-bbox-canvas/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T05:07:05.943Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-03T19:18:55.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/jimmycarter/krea2-turbo-bbox-canvas/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T05:07:05.943Z","hash":"ccc5c9816e79ee3da7e315e57fa527d2640e51330a3c913144fdc71747405937","originalBytes":1147,"storedBytes":1147,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["bbox","canvas","krea","turbo","box","comics","draggable","dsl","prompts","sdk","text","version","any","app","app.py","applies","boxes","canvas.","cfg","characters","colorfrom","colorto","comics.","compact","control","coordinates","delta","demo","description","directly","distillation","duration","editing","emoji","example","explicit","exposes","file","finetune","gradio","grid.","grounding","jimmycarter","just","krea2-turbo-bbox","landscapes","layout","layout-controlled","matter","merged","model","moving","multi-panel","multi-subject","objects","panels","photography","pink","places","plain-prose","plus","portraits","posters","product","prompt","python","realistic","red","redraws","rewrites","same","scenes","short","shots","showing","space","span","startup","steps","string","subject","textbox","timeout","title","trained","two","typography","verbatim","views","wraps"]},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/jimmycarter/krea2-turbo-bbox-canvas","attemptedAt":"2026-10-06T05:16:23.716Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T05:16:23.716Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-06T05:16:23.716Z","target":"https://jimmycarter-krea2-turbo-bbox-can